what = IntroWhat(
  "Complete build guide for the Witchhunter ascendancy Mercenary, covering dual-ailment mechanics, ascendancy synergies, gear milestones, and DPS calculations.",
  "Poison + Bleed Witchhunter is a dual-ailment DoT build in Path of Exile 2 patch 0.5 that melts enemies through simultaneous Poison and Bleed damage-over-time. It pairs Gas Grenade for area poison clouds with Barrage for rapid bleed application, synergised by the Poison 3, Bleed 3, and At Mixture keystones.",
