)

why = IntroWhy(
  "Dual-ailment DoT is one of the most forgiving endgame damage types in PoE 2 — apply ailments once and step back while ticks do the work. But misconfiguring the synergy keystones or skipping Obsessive Rituals' offensive trade-off leaves huge damage on the table.",
  "Mastering the Poison + Bleed interaction loop, Concentration management via No Mercy, and defensive positioning around Sorcery Ward turns a budget league-starter into a build capable of deleting Uber bosses.",
)
